We want to understand what happens when a TCP packet arrives at a load balancer.
Our mental model:
Client
   │
   │ Ethernet/IP/TCP packet
   ▼
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│      Load Balancer          │
│                             │
│ NIC                         │
│  ↓                          │
