Where does the information live?
local memory?
shared state?
backend reports?
metrics system?
How fresh is it?
real-time?
10ms old?
1 second old?
What's the cost?
CPU
network
memory
locks
contention
What happens when the information is wrong?
That's where real distributed-systems engineering begins.
