17. Multiple HTTP requests
Suppose HTTP/1.1 keep-alive is enabled.
Client doesn't need:
TCP connect
HTTP request
TCP close

TCP connect
HTTP request
TCP close

TCP connect
HTTP request
TCP close
Instead:
